1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The Clover Kingdom.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
In this place where magic is everything,

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
there lives one boy who was born without it.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
His name is Asta.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
His strength and determination helped him become a magic knight.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
And despite the many challenges he faces,

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
he aims for the top and refuses to give up.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Rich or poor, royalty or commoner,

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Asta believes anyone can shine.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
His mission is to prove that to the whole world

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
and to become the next Wizard King.

12
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,000
In order to defeat Megicula,

13
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,000
the devil lurking in the Spade King,

14
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
the magic knights have been training hard.

15
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
In the briny depths of the sea,

16
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
another dangerous threat has emerged.

17
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Kyoto, Kohono, you two make a run for it!

18
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,000
We can't!

19
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,000
You must!

20
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Seek the aid of the magic knights!

21
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Come on, we've gotten this far!

22
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Dad!

23
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Father!

24
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,000
He's right. Let's go.

25
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Okay.

26
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
I'll see you next time.

