84
00:04:23,100 --> 00:04:24,240
What gives?

85
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:25,960
Why can't we just train with magic?

86
00:04:26,540 --> 00:04:28,760
Because when we were fighting against the elves

87
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:31,320
Yami and Asta prove that this kind of training matters too

88
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:32,880
The stronger your body gets

89
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:34,400
The stronger your magic's gonna be

90
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:35,120
